5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. Let us approach this trial with open hearts and a spirit of cooperation. Trust is the bridge that connects us all, even in times of uncertainty.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree that cooperation is necessary, but trust must be earned through consistent behavior and factual evidence. Let us remain objective.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,I prefer to keep a distance and observe. Trusting too quickly is a luxury we cannot afford in a game of deception.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Logic dictates that we establish a baseline of behavior now. I will be analyzing your speech patterns for any inconsistencies.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,This feels like a big mystery! I'm so excited! Let's all try our best to find the werewolf together!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"@George, your caution is a sign of wisdom, but remember that isolation can sometimes be mistaken for guilt. A gentle word goes a long way.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, I share your sentiment. We should focus on who deviates from their established personality as the days progress.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,"@Servas, I appreciate the advice, but I trust my own eyes more than the words of others.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, exactly. The intersection of behavioral data and logical contradictions will be our most reliable tool.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'll just be myself! That's the easiest way, right? Hehe!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Sakura. Authenticity is a beacon of light. Let us all strive to be honest with one another.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Honesty is a goal, but we must remember that the werewolf is incentivized to lie. We cannot take any statement at face value.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,George,,"Which is why I will be watching everyone closely. The one who tries too hard to be ""helpful"" often has the most to hide.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,That is a valid hypothesis. Over-compensation in social behavior is a common tell for those under pressure.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,Oh! Does that mean George is a detective? You're acting like one!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,Let us enter the first night with peace in our minds. I believe in the goodness of this group.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Minako,,I will spend the night organizing my thoughts on our initial interactions.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,George,,I'll be observing from the shadows.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I will cross-reference the statements made today.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Goodnight everyone! Sweet dreams!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
