36,1,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. I hope you all rested well. The atmosphere feels heavy; let us support each other to find the truth.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We must be efficient. Based on the roles, we have a werewolf and a possessed. I am looking for those who are steering the conversation.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,George,,Servas is already trying to set the emotional tone. It's a classic way to deflect suspicion by appearing as a moral pillar.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@George, that is an observation, but not yet evidence. However, Servas's insistence on ""goodness"" is statistically high for a first-day response.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Everyone is being so serious! Maybe the werewolf is just shy?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@George, @Asuka, it is natural to be cautious, but let us not let suspicion turn into baseless accusations. We must remain positive.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Minako,,Positivity does not solve the problem. I have information that suggests we should look closely at certain individuals.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,George,,"@Minako, if you have information, you should be more specific. Vague hints are often used by the possessed to mislead.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, are you implying you have a role that provides data? If so, the timing of your reveal is crucial.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, is Minako the Seer? That would be so cool!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Let us not rush to conclusions. If we execute an innocent villager, we only help the werewolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I am the Seer. I divined Servas last night, and he is the werewolf.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,George,,A bold claim. But the werewolf often claims to be the Seer to frame others. I'm not convinced yet.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"If Minako is the Seer, the logic is simple: Servas must go. If Minako is lying, she has just painted a target on her own back.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Sakura,,What?! Servas is the bad guy? But he's so nice!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, that is a cruel lie. I have done nothing but offer kindness. I am a simple villager.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Minako,,"The facts do not change based on your personality, Servas. You are the werewolf.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,George,,It's a gamble. But Minako's delivery is consistent with her character. I'll lean toward her.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Asuka,,The risk of keeping a confirmed werewolf is higher than the risk of a fake Seer. I vote for Servas.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I trust Minako! Sorry, Servas!","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
